してる表情、胸を強く握られ破れたスカートや紐パンの隙間から触手が秘部に入って弄られ(性器はギリギリ見えないようお願いします)痛がる表情、行為が終わって「はぁ…はぁ…」とぐったりして涙を流してる表情のイラストもお願いします\nえのつむりさんのイラストは指先まで丁寧に描かれていてとても素晴らしかったので、クラハシコウちゃんの足指や足爪、胸や表情、腋にも描写を入れて頂けたら幸いです…！\nおでかけ服クラハシコウちゃん資料です\nhttps://x.com/not_beaver/status/1844874367559401834?t=bND2wEkTH3ubLYogogGEhw&s=19\nhttps://x.com/not_beaver/status/1845223234062721252?t=vRNFRs2erPkVyCoxc-Qvqw&s=19\nhttps://x.com/not_beaver/status/1844874367559401834?t=NhXzBEpw8INn4GBha63jVA&s=19\n\n長文失礼しました。どうぞよろしくお願いします！", "nc": 40, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 6797, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "Pd", "screen_name": "Pd_Pallad", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1877250501538099202/6twqXt4T.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 2, "complete_expiration_days": 45, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 233843, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "足ひれ", "screen_name": "asihire", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1509881494092746753/Eid9xu-U.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 271330, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "只野まぐ", "screen_name": "mug_orz", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1613140334623748096/bUZI9ida.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/336448627/1625537521/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank